[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY]
Army Modernization

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_desc]
We shall equip our valiant soldiers with state-of-the-art weaponry, ensuring that when they march into battle, they do so with the same grace as a unicorn performing a magic trick, the precision of a pegasus delivering a rainstorm on demand, and the strength of an earth pony kicking an apple tree.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY]
陆军现代化

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_desc]
我们将为我们勇敢的士兵配备最先进的武器，确保他们在战斗中行进时，就像一只独角兽表演魔术一样优雅，一只飞马提供所需的暴雨一样精确，一只陆马踢倒一棵苹果树一样强力。

